{"ID":"20240118151230-yb4occ4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151230-yb4occ4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151230-yb4occ4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151230-djdd9rv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113029-j9fdqeo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113029-j9fdqeo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:348,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:348\u0026#125;","title":"122蜂子蜂蜜蜂蜡","type":"doc","updated":"20240130143349"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151230-djdd9rv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151230-djdd9rv","updated":"20240122112855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主风头，除蛊毒，补虚羸伤中，久服令人光泽好颜色不老，大黄蜂子主心腹胀满痛，轻身益气，土蜂子主痈肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112900-oeb8nwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112900-oeb8nwq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国南方诸省岩岭间，今江浙之间多自养蜂，出蜜佳，国外产者亦佳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112902-jaayjvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112902-jaayjvr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112903-uh5y09h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112903-uh5y09h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蜂蜜为润脏腑要药，主益气补中，滋养脾胃，调和营卫，治五脏不足，肠胃燥结，肌肉疼痛，除心烦，疗肠澼，作榳入谷道，导便秘。蜂蜡为止血，安胎，补益药，治孕妇胎动下血有殊效，又为硬膏基础剂。蜜蜂子为补虚，解毒药，治麻风病及肠寄生虫结聚腹痛，滇越等地常以油炸佐膳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112906-dqoq8b9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112906-dqoq8b9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】蜂蜜益气补中，止痛解毒，除众病，和百药，久服强志轻身。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112915-mv9aap6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112915-mv9aap6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】蜂蜜治牙齿疳虫，唇口疮，目肤赤障，杀虫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112916-8y3fqy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112916-8y3fqy5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】蜂蜜治心腹血气刺痛，及白痢，同生地黄汁各一匙服，即下。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112918-5a81sp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112918-5a81sp4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】蜂蜡主下利脓血，补中，续绝伤金疮，益气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112920-lphj5e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112920-lphj5e7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】蜂蜡主孕妇胎动，下血不绝欲死，以鸡子大煎三五沸。投美酒半升立愈，又主白发镊去，消蜡点孔中即生黑发。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112922-pja13it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112922-pja13it"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】蜜蜂子治头风，除蛊毒，补虚羸伤中，久服令人光泽。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112925-f2k91rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112925-f2k91rs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】蜜蜂子治心腹痛，面目黄，大人小儿腹中五虫从口吐出者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112928-akw81mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112928-akw81mi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】蜜蜂子主丹毒风疹，腹中留热，利大小便涩，去浮血，下乳汁，妇人带下病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112932-jwmm5uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112932-jwmm5uu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】可做食品，无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112933-h8ftex5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112933-h8ftex5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112935-91yzwu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112935-91yzwu5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】阴头生疮——以蜜煎甘草涂之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112941-01bsmg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112941-01bsmg4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肛门生疮——白蜜一斤、猪胆汁一枚相和，微火煎令可丸，作挺长约三寸，大如手指，涂油纳肛门内，卧令后重，须臾通泻。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112946-z501z80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112946-z501z80"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"热油灼痛——以白蜜涂之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112949-re16cko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112949-re16cko"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝虚雀目——黄蜡溶汁，入蛤粉相合所得，冷却，每以二钱夹入猪肝内煮之，乘热食肝饮汁，日二，以平安为度。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112959-szr8akh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112959-szr8akh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大风疠疾——须眉已无，皮肉已烂成疮者：蜜蜂子，胡蜂子，黄蜂子并炒各一分，白花蛇，乌梢蛇并酒浸去皮骨炙干，全蝎，僵蚕并炒，各一两，地龙炒半两，蝎虎（守宫），赤足蜈蚣各15条，丹砂一两，雄黄一分（醋炒），龙脑半钱，共为细末，每服一钱匕，蜜汤调下，月三五服。（圣济）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122112852-gozrajq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122112852-gozrajq"}},{"ID":"20240122113002-c54vh5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113002-c54vh5z"}},{"ID":"20240122113002-4vz80im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113002-4vz80im","updated":"20240122113006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再过来呢。糖的后面呢。你看一百二十二。蜂蜜，蜂子，蜂蜡。这是蜜蜂。蜜蜂窝里面通通可以找到。过去呢我们中药用丸散膏丹做成丸剂的时候。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113006-0qip5ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113006-0qip5ae","updated":"20240130142811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丸剂的时候我们会用蜂蜜。蜂蜜我们先熬过。熬过以后把水份再蒸发点。然后蜂蜜跟我们的药粉混在一起。做成药丸。不然没有蜂蜜做粘着剂的话。这个没有办法做成丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113014-8yaxw4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113014-8yaxw4h","updated":"20240130142911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜂蜜是很好的补中益气。对肠胃非常好。滋润脏腑的重要的药。那如果说老师我今天什么东西都吃不下了。东西都吃不下怎么办。你喝糖水啊喝蜂蜜至少能够保持元气在那边。都可以用。能够保持。所以临床上的时候看你怎么样使用。那这个你看它说滋养脾胃你看它主治。它滋养脾胃，调和营卫，治五脏不足，肠胃燥结，肌肉疼痛通通可以。所以它是滋润的药。味甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113019-fd1dzv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113019-fd1dzv4","updated":"20240130143019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那《神农本草经》的原文呢说它可以除蛊毒除虫的毒。补虚羸伤中。常服的话让人年轻看起来气血非常好。那九十六页。开始的时候它说放在肛门里面去捣大便。在经方里面《伤寒论》里面有蜜煎导法。蜜煎导法就是用蜂蜜把它熬熬熬很浓水份一直发掉。然后挥发掉以后呢。在它挥发越来越粘嘛越煮越粘快要结晶的时候你一直在翻动它。就会变成一个圆椎形的。一个椎形的想办法弄成椎形的。或者是你把它放在一个椎形的模子里面很烫哦要小心。所以倒进去变成一个椎形的。这个时候你塞到肛门里面去。西医用甘油碇。中医通大便。大便排不出来肛门口太硬我们塞蜂蜜进去。但是你这个蜂蜜软软粘粘的你怎么塞进去。那必须要用做的熬过以后。指这个意思。能够导便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113020-g4sy10w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113020-g4sy10w","updated":"20240130143229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜂蜡也是一种。在蜜蜂窝里看到就像蜡一样在底下。能够止血安胎。补益增补的药。这个蜂蜡跟蜂蜜都很甜。蜂蜜子为补虚，解毒的药，治麻风还有一些肠子寄生虫。那甄权呢。他说这个蜂蜡止孕妇胎动。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜂蜡一块块像鸡蛋黄那么大一个。怎么做你看。他就跟你讲。可以治疗白发。你可以把白的头发呢把它拔起来。拔起来呢那个洞点一下那个蜂蜡在里面。再生出来就是黑发。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个都无所谓你可以试看看。当然你精神要很多。因为有时一票白发。一搓哇。很麻烦的。所以干脆你说老师一个个点。不要那么笨。你把它拔出来后把蜡给它通通涂上去。不一定说一定要点那个洞嘛。那么傻。那附方诸位可以参考一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240122113029-j9fdqeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113029-j9fdqeo","updated":"20240130143349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后面附方最后一条。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大风疠疾这个就是讲的是麻风病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。麻风病在中国欧洲的时候看到麻风病就吓死了。把你隔离起来。传染很厉害嘛。主要症状眉毛头发鼻子皮肤连鼻子都掉我们这样讲。鼻子自然掉下来。因为烂掉了。结成疮掉下来。这个时候呢你们可以用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜜蜂子，胡蜂子，黄蜂子什么这种当然用的比较强烈剧毒的药。这些来治疗麻风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那经方有没有。有。我们会介绍到《伤寒》《金匮》的时候会提示一些。可以治症。那至于治症到实际上的情形。情形到底如何。临床那么多年我没有看到。因为我们没有这种机会嘛。哪天有机会我们跑到四川的麻风村进去看看。我敢进去哦。我们有一个很好保护自己的方式啊。《黄帝内经》里面不是有吗。疠疾我们可以预防。自己的方式。到那边看看临床说不定可以找到很好的方法。有很多药物要临床有机会看到就开出处方来那是最好的。"}]}]}